{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34327","headline":"江墅言怀 · 陆龟蒙","name":"江墅言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病身兼稚子，田舍劣相容。\n迹共公卿绝，贫须稼穑供。\n月方行到闰，霜始近言浓。\n树少栖禽杂，村孤守犬重。\n汀洲藏晚弋，篱落露寒舂。\n野弁欹还整，家书拆又封。\n杉篁宜夕照，窗户倚疎钟。\n南北唯闻战，纵横未胜农。\n大春虽苦学，叔夜本多慵。\n直使貂裘弊，犹堪过一冬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34327.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34327","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}